      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 1,
   "id": "9b43577",
   "doc": "wp-post#145815",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "FSO vs. RSO: What’s the Difference? | Cape Cod Cannabis",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>When searching for the <b>best dispensary near me</b> on Cape Cod, many customers want to know more about different types of cannabis oils—especially <b><a href=\"/?s=fso\">Full-Spectrum Oil</a> (FSO)</b> and <b><a href=\"/?s=rso\">Rick Simpson Oil</a> (RSO)</b>. At <b>Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA</b>, we believe that an informed customer is a confident customer. Here’s a clear comparison to help you understand the key differences, benefits, and uses of FSO vs. RSO.</p><p>The main difference is that RSO (<a href=\"/?s=rso\">Rick Simpson Oil</a>) is a specific type of high-potency, full-spectrum oil originally created by Rick Simpson using a particular solvent (often alcohol) and high-THC strains, while FSO (<a href=\"/?s=fso\">Full-Spectrum Oil</a>) is a broader category for whole-plant extracts that preserve the cannabis plant’s full profile of cannabinoids, terpenes, and other compounds, which can be made with various solvents and processes. Essentially, RSO is a well-known historical example of FSO, but most commercial “RSO” products are now carefully monitored FSOs.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Is Full-Spectrum Oil (FSO)?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>Full-Spectrum Oil (FSO)</b> is a cannabis extract that contains the full range of cannabinoids, terpenes, flavonoids, and other natural plant compounds. This means it includes <b>THC, CBD, CBG, and minor cannabinoids</b> working together in what’s known as the <b>entourage effect</b>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Benefits of FSO:"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p>Balanced cannabinoid profile for a well-rounded effect</p></li><li><p>Preserves terpenes, which may enhance flavor and therapeutic benefits</p></li><li><p>Available in tinctures, capsules, and vape cartridges</p></li><li><p>Suitable for daytime or evening use depending on the strain</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Is Rick Simpson Oil (RSO)?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>Rick Simpson Oil (RSO)</b> is a highly concentrated cannabis oil named after its creator, Rick Simpson. Unlike most extracts, RSO is typically <b>very high in THC</b> and often used by medical cannabis patients seeking strong, long-lasting effects.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Benefits of RSO:"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p>Extremely potent with high THC levels</p></li><li><p>Typically ingested orally in small doses (grain-of-rice size)</p></li><li><p>Often chosen for wellness-focused use and relief management</p></li><li><p>Sticky, tar-like consistency</p></li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Key Differences Between FSO and RSO"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<table><thead><tr><th><p><b>Feature</b></p></th><th><p><b>Full-Spectrum Oil (FSO)</b></p></th><th><p><b>Rick Simpson Oil (RSO)</b></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Cannabinoid Profile</p></td><td><p>Broad mix of THC, CBD &amp; minor cannabinoids</p></td><td><p>High THC concentration</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Terpenes</p></td><td><p>Retains natural flavors &amp; aromas</p></td><td><p>Often stronger, earthy taste</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Usage</p></td><td><p>Tinctures, vapes, edibles</p></td><td><p>Orally (small doses), capsules</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Potency</p></td><td><p>Moderate to strong</p></td><td><p>Very strong (high-THC)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Best For</p></td><td><p>Everyday balance, entourage effect</p></td><td><p>Targeted relief, medical use</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Which One Is Right for You?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li><p>If you’re looking for <b>balanced effects, natural flavor, and everyday versatility</b>, <a href=\"/?s=fso\"><b>FSO</b></a> might be the better fit.</p></li><li><p>If you’re seeking <b>high potency, long-lasting relief, or targeted medical benefits</b>, <a href=\"/?s=rso\"><b>RSO</b></a> may be more suitable.</p></li></ul><p>Our <b>knowledgeable Cape Cod Cannabis team in Wellfleet</b> is here to <a href=\"/faqs-420/\">answer your questions</a> and guide you toward the product that fits your needs best.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Shop Cannabis Oils & Cannabis products on Cape Cod"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Searching for a <b>dispensary near me</b> with high-quality cannabis oils? At <b>Cape Cod Cannabis</b>, we carry a wide selection of <b><a href=\"/?s=fso\">Full-Spectrum Oils (FSO)</a>, <a href=\"/?s=rso\">Rick Simpson Oil (RSO)</a>, <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a>, <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vaporizers</a>, <a href=\"/categories/edibles/\">edibles</a>, <a href=\"/categories/flower/\">flower</a>, <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, <a href=\"/categories/topicals/\">topicals</a>, <a href=\"/categories/seeds/\">cannabis seeds</a>, <a href=\"/categories/cbd/\">CBD</a> and <a href=\"/categories/pre-rolls/\">pre-rolls</a></b>. Whether you’re a local resident or visiting the Cape, we provide top-notch products, friendly service, and convenient online ordering for in-store pickup.</p><p><a href=\"/directions/\">Visit us today in South Wellfleet</a>, right off Route 6, and discover why Cape Cod Cannabis is the <b>#1 choice for dispensaries on Cape Cod</b>.</p>"
    }
   ]
